    "diagramPlacement": "right-of-prompt",
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2.332\\text{ m}$",
      "worked": "Let $d$ metres be the diagonal length.\n$$\\begin{align*}d^2&=1.2^2+2^2\\\\d^2&=5.44\\\\d&=\\sqrt{5.44}\\text{ m}\\\\d&\\approx2.332\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$\nThe diagonal piece must be $2.332\\text{ m}$ long, correct to 3 decimal places.",
